<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Annabi Naxumu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Naxumu bɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Annabi Naxumu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nax</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Naxumu bɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Asiriya xa mangɛya nu bara sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ ɲɛ kɛmɛ solomasaxan beenu Annabi Isa xa bari Isirayila bɔxi ma tɛmui naxɛ. Na waxati ɲamanɛ birin nu na a xa yaamari xɔrɔxɔɛ bun ma. Ninewe nu findixi a xa mangataa nan na. Asiriyakae mu nu birama Alatala xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra fefe ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na kui Annabi Naxumu Isirayilaka naxa yi masenyi ti e xa fe ra. Masenyi na a ra naxan xɔrɔxɔ, barima e xa fe mu nu rafanxi Ala ma. Annabi Naxumu to gɛ Ala xa sɛnbɛ magaaxuxi masende Asiriyakae bɛ, a naxa a fala e bɛ e fama gbaloe ɲaaxi sɔtɔde e xa yunubie xa fe ra. Na kiiti nu fatanxi Ala nan na. Ala naxa Babilɔnkae xɛɛ Ninewe kanade ɲɛ kɛmɛ senni beenu Annabi Isa xa waxati.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na masenyi nu xɔrɔxɔ Asiriyakae bɛ, kɔnɔ a nu findixi fe fanyi nan na Isirayilakae bɛ, naxee nu tɔɔrɔma e yaxuie xa yaamari bun ma. Annabi Naxumu naxa a masen e bɛ a yunubitɔɛe fama e xa kobiɲa sare sɔtɔde Alatala yi ra. Ala xa kiiti xɔrɔxɔɛ Asiriyakae bɛ, a nu limaniya fima Isirayilakae ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hali to, Ala xa ɲama nɔma sɛɛwade na xa fe ra. E xa a kolon Alatala fama mixi ɲaaxie makiitide, a fa e sare ragbilen e ma. Won birin a kolon tinxinyi fan, kɔnɔ a nɔma lude won bɛ alɔ tinxintareya na sɔɔnɛyafe yi duniɲa kui, barima fe ɲaaxi gbo, tinxintɔɛe fan na tɔɔrɔfe. Yi kitaabui a masenma won bɛ tinxintare mu geenima, Alatala xa tinxinyi nan mixi geenima duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari nun aligiyama. Ala xa mixi birin makiiti a xa sɛriyɛ ra. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Naxumu bɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NAM 1" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa xɔnɛ Ninewe xili ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 1:1" />Masenyi xɔrɔxɔɛ nan ya Ninewe xa fe ra, Ala naxan masen Annabi Naxumu Elekosika bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:1">Alatala magaaxu, a gbeɲɔxɔfe mu kanama.<verse eid="NAM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 1:2" />Alatala a gbeɲɔxɔma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:2">a xa xɔnɛ sɛnbɛ gbo a yaxuie mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:2">a mu diɲɛma e ma mafuren mafuren.<verse eid="NAM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 1:3" />Kɔnɔ Alatala mu xɔnɔma mafuren mafuren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:3">a sɛnbɛ gbo han.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:3">Alatala mixi ɲaaxi sare ragbilenma nɛ fe ɲaaxi rabae ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:3">A xa ɲɛrɛ luma nɛ alɔ turunnaadɛ naxan xube ratema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:3">a tixi nuxuie fari.<verse eid="NAM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 1:4" />A na xaaɲɛ baa ma, a xɔrima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:4">a xure birin naxara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:4">a Basan nun Karemele findi gbengberenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:4">a Liban sansie lisima nɛ.<verse eid="NAM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 1:5" />A geyae rasɛrɛnma nɛ, e xunu alɔ kumi ture.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:5">Bɔxi sɛrɛnma nɛ a ya i, duniɲa mixie bɔɲɛ minima nɛ.<verse eid="NAM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 1:6" />Nde nɔma tide a xa xɔnɛ ya ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:6">Nde nɔma tide a xa bɔɲɛte ya i?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:6">A xa xɔnɛ luma nɛ alɔ tɛ, naxan gɛmɛe bulama.<verse eid="NAM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 1:7" />Alatala fan, a kantari fima nɛ tɔɔrɔmixie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:7">a mɛɛnima nɛ mixie ma naxee e yɛtɛ taxuma a ra.<verse eid="NAM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 1:8" />Kɔnɔ a Ninewe xun nakanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:8">a a yaxuie kerima dimi nan kui.<verse eid="NAM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 1:9" />Ninewe, wo fɛɛrɛ mundun fenfe Alatala xili ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:9">A tan nan sɔntɔɛ tima kerenyi ra.<verse eid="NAM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 1:10" />E fama nɛ lude alɔ e kankanxi tunbe kunsie nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:10">alɔ e siisixi beere nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:10">alɔ sɛxɛ xaraxi naxan ganxi feo.<verse eid="NAM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 1:11" />Nineweka nde bara fe ɲaaxi raba Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:11">a mixie rasixi fe kobi nan ma.<verse eid="NAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 1:12" />Ala xa masenyi nan ya e xa fe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:12">«Hali wo yaxuie wuya, e xun fama nɛ rakanade, e ɲɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:12">N bara wo tan Yudayakae tɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:12">kɔnɔ n mu na rabama sɔnɔn.<verse eid="NAM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 1:13" />Yakɔsi n wo bama nɛ wo yaxuie xa nɔɛ bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:13">n luutie bolon wo xirixi naxee ra.»<verse eid="NAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 1:14" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya wo tan Ninewekae xa fe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">«Wo bɔnsɔɛ fama nɛ ɲɔnde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">N wo xa kuye masolixie nun wo xa kuye naxee yailanxi wure ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">naxee na wo xa alae xa banxie kui, n nee birin kanama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">N wo sɔntɔma nɛ, barima wo ɲaaxu.»<verse eid="NAM 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NAM 2" />
  <para style="s">Ninewe xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 2:1" />Xɛɛra na fafe geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">a fafe xibaarui fanyi ra wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">a bɔɲɛsa masenyi nan tima wo bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">Yudayakae, wo xa wo xa salie raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">wo xa wo xa laayidie rakamali Ala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">barima mixi ɲaaxie mu fama wo sɔntɔde sɔnɔn.<verse eid="NAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 2:2" />Ninewekae, wo yaxuie na fafe wo xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:2">Wo wo xa tɛtɛ makanta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:2">wo mɛɛni wo xa kira ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:2">wo wo tagi ixiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:2">wo xa limaniya, wo xa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ,<verse eid="NAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 2:3" />barima Alatala fama nɛ Yaxuba xun nakelide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:3">a fama nɛ Isirayila itede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:3">hali kasarɛ to ti e xa bɔxi ma, e xa sansie naxa tuxunsan.<verse eid="NAM 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 2:4" />Wo yaxuie xa sɔɔrie na wure lefae gbeelixi xaninfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:4">donma gbeeli ragoroxi e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:4">E xa sɔɔri ragisee yanbama a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:4">e xa tanbɛe xaaɲɛxi gere xili ma.<verse eid="NAM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 2:5" />Na gisee e gima kirae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:5">e gbataxi sofe ra gere kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:5">E luxi alɔ seyamakɔnyi naxan dangima koore ra.<verse eid="NAM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 2:6" />Sɔɔri sugandixie xɛɛma naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:6">e xulun sigafe ra taa tɛtɛ yire, e sa gere so.<verse eid="NAM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 2:7" />E mangɛ xa banxi naadɛ rabi, e birin so na kui.<verse eid="NAM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 2:8" />Yaamari fixi taakae xa xanin konyiya kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:8">A xa ginɛe sigama nɛ wa ra sunnunyi kui.<verse eid="NAM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 2:9" />Ninewe bara lu alɔ ye ragatade ibɔɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:9">a ye fa mini bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:9">Nde a falama, «Wo ba na rabafe, wo keli naa.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:9">Kɔnɔ mixi yo mu gbilenma na fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="NAM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 2:10" />Booree a falama, «Wo gbeti nun xɛɛma tongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:10">Naafuli gbegbe na e yi ra.»<verse eid="NAM 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 2:11" />Kasarɛ, tuxunsanyi, nun gbaloe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:11">Limaniya bara ba e yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:11">e sanyie mu xanfe e bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:11">e bɔɲɛ na tɔɔrɔfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:11">e lahalɛ bara masara.<verse eid="NAM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 2:12" />Taa sɛnbɛma naxan nu luxi alɔ yɛtɛ lude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:12">yɛtɛ yɔrɛe nun e nga nu malabuxi xaxilisa kui dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:12">na taa munse sɔtɔxi yi ki?<verse eid="NAM 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 2:13" />Na yɛtɛ sɛnbɛma nu sube faxama a xa ginɛ nun a xa die bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:13">a nu a xɔnyi rafema sube ibɔɔxi ra.<verse eid="NAM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 2:14" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:14">«N kelima nɛ wo xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:14">n wo xa sɔɔri ragisee ganma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:14">n wo xa yɛtɛ yɔrɛe faxama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:14">n sube birin bama nɛ wo yi ra duniɲa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:14">Wo xa xɛɛrae xui mu mɛma sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="NAM 2:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NAM 3" />
  <para style="s">Ninewe xa ɲɔnyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 3:1" />Ɲaxankatɛ na yi taa faxɛti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:1">naxan nafexi yanfanteya, se muɲaxie, nun tɔɔrɔmixie ra.<verse eid="NAM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 3:2" />Luxusinyi xui minima naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:2">sɔɔri ragise sanyie xui minima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:2">soee e gima, sɔɔri ragise e imaxama.<verse eid="NAM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 3:3" />Soe ragie geresoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">santidɛgɛma lintanma alɔ tɛ luutie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">tanbɛ wolima alɔ seyamakɔnyie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">mixi faxaxie ralantanxi yire birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">fure saxie mu ɲɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">mixie e sanyi radinma furee ra.<verse eid="NAM 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 3:4" />Na birin fatanxi a xa sɛniyɛntareɲa nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:4">A sie mabɛndunma a xa langoeɲa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:4">a ɲamanɛe madaxuma a duureya ra.<verse eid="NAM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 3:5" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:5">«N kelima nɛ wo xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:5">n wo rayaagima nɛ si birin ya xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:5">n wo mageli ti ɲamanɛe birin ya i.<verse eid="NAM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 3:6" />N wo makotoma nɛ nɔxɔɛ ra, n wo rayaagi.<verse eid="NAM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 3:7" />Na kui, mixi yo na wo to, a a gima nɛ wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:7">a fa a fala, ‹Ninewe bara kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:7">Nde kinikinima a ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:7">Nde a madunduma?›»<verse eid="NAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 3:8" />Ninewe, wo fisa Tebese bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:8">taa naxan dɔxɔxi Nili xure salonyie tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:8">ye gbo dɛnnaxɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:8">Baa nu findixi a xa tɛtɛ makantaxi nan na.<verse eid="NAM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 3:9" />Kusi nun Misira nu sɛnbɛ fima nɛ a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:9">Puti nun Libiya nu a malima.<verse eid="NAM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 3:10" />Kɔnɔ Tebese fan bara xanin konyiya kui ɲamanɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:10">a xa die bara faxa kira xunyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:10">a xa kuntigie bara mayegeti sigafe ra konyiya kui.<verse eid="NAM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 3:11" />Wo tan dagalanma nɛ alɔ siisilae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:11">wo wo nɔxunma nɛ wo yaxuie ya ra.<verse eid="NAM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 3:12" />Wo xa banxi makantaxie luxi nɛ alɔ xɔrɛ bilie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:12">foye naxee bogi rayolonma mixie xa debe kui naxee wama e donfe.<verse eid="NAM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 3:13" />Ginɛ doro nan fa luxi wo xa bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:13">sɔɔrie mu na sɔnɔn naxee wo makantama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:13">wo xa naadɛe rabixi wo yaxuie ya ra, tɛ bara na balansee gan.<verse eid="NAM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 3:14" />Wo ye ba, barima gere na fafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:14">wo nde sa wo xa tɛtɛ fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:14">Wo boora rafala, wo biriki bɔnbɔ.<verse eid="NAM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 3:15" />Mɛnni, tɛ fama nɛ wo xa taa gande alɔ tugumie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:15">santidɛgɛma fama nɛ wo sɔntɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:15">Wo wo malan alɔ tugumie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:15">wo wo malan alɔ katoe.<verse eid="NAM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NAM 3:16" />Wo bara yulɛe rawuya wo xɔnyi dangife tunbuie ra koore ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:16">Wo bara lu alɔ tugumie naxee tuganma, e siga.<verse eid="NAM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NAM 3:17" />Wo xa sɔɔrie luxi nɛ alɔ tugumi naxee na tɛtɛ fari gɛɛsɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:17">kɔnɔ soge na te, e tugan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:17">e siga yire mixi mu dɛnnaxɛ kolon.<verse eid="NAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NAM 3:18" />Asiriya mangɛ, i xa yareratie na xife,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:18">i xa kuntigie saxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:18">i xa ɲama bara yensen yɛ geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:18">mixi yo mu nɔma e xunlande.<verse eid="NAM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NAM 3:19" />I xa gbaloe gbo, i xa fi mu yalanma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:19">Mixi naxee birin i xa tɔɔrɛ xa fe mɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:19">e e bɛlɛxɛ bɔnbɔma nɛ ɲɛlɛxinyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:19">barima mixi yo mu na wo mu kobiɲa rabaxi naxan na.<verse eid="NAM 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 3" />
</usx>